It's not high. Come on.

974
01:15:44.240 --> 01:15:45.839
No, I can't. I'm afraid of heights.

975
01:15:45.840 --> 01:15:47.999
- I don't know what to do!
- Just trust me. Sit down.

976
01:15:48.000 --> 01:15:49.326
Okay? Sit down.

977
01:15:51.640 --> 01:15:53.879
Just close your eyes
and count to three.

978
01:15:53.880 --> 01:15:55.439
All right? On three.

979
01:15:55.440 --> 01:15:56.926
One, two...

980
01:16:02.880 --> 01:16:06.926
<i>Unit 445, there are no other
units available at this time.</i>

981
01:16:09.480 --> 01:16:11.808
