All right, don't kill us.

995
01:17:36.480 --> 01:17:37.841
That's nice.

996
01:17:38.600 --> 01:17:39.999
Have you got her?

997
01:17:40.000 --> 01:17:41.770
- Yeah.
- All right.

998
01:17:43.560 --> 01:17:45.046
Good.

999
01:17:45.320 --> 01:17:47.841
Good, good, good.

1000
01:18:42.720 --> 01:18:44.319
Jesus!

1001
01:18:44.320 --> 01:18:45.359
That was on purpose.

1002
01:18:45.360 --> 01:18:46.925
Yeah, thanks to Dino's bounty.

1003
01:18:49.640 --> 01:18:51.001
They're coming at you.

1004
01:18:52.640 --> 01:18:54.001
<i>Copy that.</i>

1005
01:18:55.120 --> 01:18:57.079
Wait, wait. See? They're
trying to trap us.

1006
01:18:57.080 --> 01:18:58.399
Here, just drift onto the shoulder.

1007
01:18:58.400 --> 01:19:00.039
No, no, no, I'm going
for the Hummer.

1008
01:19:00.040 --> 01:19:01.479
He's a pavement prowler.

1009
01:19:01.480 --> 01:19:02.599
Pavement what?

1010
01:19:02.600 --> 01:19:05.039
It's a show car with
a big lift kit.

1011
01:19:05.040 --> 01:19:07.686
It makes up for his
inferiority complex.

1012
01:19:12.840 --> 01:19:14.041
Wait. Are you crazy?

1013
01:19:16.080 --> 01:19:17.930
Wait, wait! Whoa, whoa!

1014
01:19:21.520 --> 01:19:23.210
Whoa! Jesus!

1015
01:19:27.120 --> 01:19:28.810
You are crazy!

1016
01:19:30.440 --> 01:19:32.483
Nice. Nice, nice.

1017
01:19:42.440 --> 01:19:43.721
No, keep it straight!

1018
01:19:48.040 --> 01:19:49.241
Holy shit.

1019
01:19:50.120 --> 01:19:51.560
Okay, Larry, bring it.

1020
01:19:51.640 --> 01:19:53.922
<i>Got it. We're moving out.</i>

1021
01:19:56.640 --> 01:19:58.683
Shoot the tires, but
don't kill them.

1022
01:20:03.680 --> 01:20:04.919
All right. Now, when I say,

1023
01:20:04.920 --> 01:20:07.439
you're gonna let up on the gas and
you're gonna make a hard left.

1024
01:20:07.440 --> 01:20:08.519
- Okay?
- Okay.

1025
01:20:08.520 --> 01:20:09.559
- Okay!
- Okay.

1026
01:20:09.560 --> 01:20:10.999
Your instincts are gonna say...

1027
01:20:11.000 --> 01:20:12.201
Just do it!

1028
01:20:13.520 --> 01:20:14.767
Now!

1029
01:20:23.800 --> 01:20:25.047
Don't let up.

1030
01:20:27.200 --> 01:20:29.320
Blast those buggers.
We'll get them on the split.

1031
01:20:42.920 --> 01:20:44.884
Hey, Liar One, you
got your ears on?

1032
01:20:50.480 --> 01:20:51.727
Son of a bitch!

1033
01:20:53.360 --> 01:20:54.721
We need to find another road.

1034
01:20:57.000 --> 01:20:58.725
Liar One, we need you!

1035
01:21:06.560 --> 01:21:08.171
You gotta go faster.

1036
01:21:10.480 --> 01:21:12.170
No, two hands on the wheel!

1037
01:21:21.960 --> 01:21:23.321
Shit!

1038
01:21:34.200 --> 01:21:35.765
Liar One, is that you?

1039
01:21:40.160 --> 01:21:41.521
Hook up, hook up!

1040
01:21:47.160 --> 01:21:49.681
Sergeant Jackson, this is
not what we discussed.

1041
01:21:49.840 --> 01:21:52.239
Sir, will you relax? Okay?

1042
01:21:52.240 --> 01:21:53.851
I got this.

1043
01:22:00.800 --> 01:22:01.959
We're good!

1044
01:22:01.960 --> 01:22:04.811
You gotta tell me you believe I can
fly an Apache helicopter, man.

1045
01:22:05.240 --> 01:22:07.204
- What?
<i>- I'm serious, bro.</i>

1046
01:22:07.640 --> 01:22:09.479
<i>You're always trying to play me.</i>

1047
01:22:09.480 --> 01:22:11.199
<i>Tell me you believe I can
fly an Apache helicopter.</i>

1048
01:22:11.200 --> 01:22:13.039
Tell him whatever he wants!

1049
01:22:13.040 --> 01:22:15.049
Yeah, you can fly an
Apache helicopter!

1050
01:22:15.360 --> 01:22:16.519
And my handle is Maverick.

1051
01:22:16.520 --> 01:22:18.281
Gotta call me Maverick,
let me hear it.

1052
01:22:18.360 --> 01:22:20.210
Maverick! Maverick!

1053
01:22:20.320 --> 01:22:21.726
Maverick!

1054
01:22:22.160 --> 01:22:23.885
Was that so bad?

1055
01:22:24.040 --> 01:22:25.199
Shit!

1056
01:22:25.200 --> 01:22:26.526
Benny!

1057
01:22:31.200 --> 01:22:32.970
Holy shit!

1058
01:22:47.320 --> 01:22:50.171
- Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
- Julia, hey!

1059
01:22:50.200 --> 01:22:51.606
Look at me.

1060
01:22:52.760 --> 01:22:54.530
Just breathe. Breathe.

1061
01:22:56.560 --> 01:22:58.489
Good.

1062
01:23:03.160 --> 01:23:04.999
Look into my eyes.

1063
01:23:05.000 --> 01:23:07.248
Look into my eyes. Good.

1064
01:23:08.520 --> 01:23:10.449
What color are they?

1065
01:23:12.120 --> 01:23:14.402
They're really blue.

1066
01:23:14.440 --> 01:23:16.519
They're really blue. Good, good.

1067
01:23:16.520 --> 01:23:19.319
They're a lot bluer than yours.

1068
01:23:19.320 --> 01:23:21.079
- No!
- Yes, they are.

1069
01:23:21.080 --> 01:23:22.799
- They're not!
- Yes!

1070
01:23:22.800 --> 01:23:24.199
They're not bluer!

1071
01:23:24.200 --> 01:23:26.607
- Admit it!
- Mine are bluer!

1072
01:23:28.240 --> 01:23:29.851
- Oh, God!
- Wow.

1073
01:23:31.720 --> 01:23:33.959
Benny! Don't drop us!

1074
01:23:33.960 --> 01:23:35.161
What?

1075
01:23:35.880 --> 01:23:37.599
I'm kidding. I'm kidding.

1076
01:23:37.600 --> 01:23:39.529
I'm kidding. We're
good, we're good.

1077
01:23:50.800 --> 01:23:52.001
What the hell is that?

1078
01:24:07.080 --> 01:24:08.406
Yeah!

1079
01:24:09.320 --> 01:24:10.999
Yeah!

1080
01:24:11.000 --> 01:24:13.079
Yeah, Tobey!

1081
01:24:13.080 --> 01:24:14.566
Hey, Benny!

1082
01:24:14.640 --> 01:24:16.399
We believe you, baby!

1083
01:24:16.400 --> 01:24:18.648
We believe you, Maverick!

1084
01:24:22.640 --> 01:24:24.679
Look at me, bitches!

1085
01:24:24.680 --> 01:24:26.086
We're good!

1086
01:24:26.520 --> 01:24:27.721
Yeah!

1087
01:24:29.640 --> 01:24:30.966
Go!

1088
01:24:39.360 --> 01:24:40.719
Are you guys Okay?

1089
01:24:40.720 --> 01:24:41.921
Yeah.

1090
01:24:47.960 --> 01:24:51.639
<i>Major Davis, you are in
violation of your flight plan.</i>

1091
01:24:51.640 --> 01:24:52.841
My bad.

1092
01:24:52.960 --> 01:24:55.686
<i>Return that bird to
base immediately.</i>

1093
01:24:57.200 --> 01:24:59.359
Looks like I'm gonna have to
go away for a while, y'all.

1094
01:24:59.360 --> 01:25:01.562
But Benny always comes back.

1095
01:25:03.360 --> 01:25:07.167
Godspeed, boys. Godspeed.

1096
01:26:07.160 --> 01:26:09.647
You're 23 minutes late.

1097
01:26:16.720 --> 01:26:18.843
- Are you checking in, sir?
- I'll be right back.

1098
01:26:38.600 --> 01:26:41.167
I'm surprised you made it.

1099
01:26:41.600 --> 01:26:43.689
I'm impressed.

1100
01:26:45.480 --> 01:26:48.365
What's going on in that
head of yours, Tobey?

1101
01:26:49.680 --> 01:26:52.326
You never went back for him.

1102
01:26:53.720 --> 01:26:55.763
I wasn't there,

1103
01:26:56.480 --> 01:26:58.444
remember?

1104
01:26:58.960 --> 01:27:02.119
I was there to comfort
Anita at the funeral.

1105
01:27:02.120 --> 01:27:03.970
Such a sweet, innocent girl.

1106
01:27:08.440 --> 01:27:10.688
Do you wanna do this here?

1107
01:27:12.400 --> 01:27:14.887
Because one of us is on parole.

1108
01:27:16.800 --> 01:27:19.526
But you know that, right?

1109
01:27:27.840 --> 01:27:30.520
We'll settle this behind the wheel.

1110
01:27:32.240 --> 01:27:34.479
I'm not worried about
you behind the wheel.

1111
01:27:34.480 --> 01:27:36.205
Really?

1112
01:27:37.000 --> 01:27:39.931
Why did you put a bounty on me?

1113
01:27:41.160 --> 01:27:42.964
Tomorrow is gonna be fun.

1114
01:27:43.560 --> 01:27:44.919
Yeah.

1115
01:27:44.920 --> 01:27:48.519
When you're hanging
upside down tomorrow,

1116
01:27:48.520 --> 01:27:50.370
I'm not coming back for you.

1117
01:27:52.840 --> 01:27:55.281
Watch yourself, Tobey.

1118
01:27:57.640 --> 01:27:59.365
See you tomorrow.

1119
01:28:40.520 --> 01:28:42.927
You ran into him, didn't you?

1120
01:28:45.320 --> 01:28:47.249
You need to forget about it.

1121
01:28:48.000 --> 01:28:49.725
You need to let it go.

1122
01:28:54.200 --> 01:28:55.879
I think you need to
get out of the car.

1123
01:28:55.880 --> 01:28:59.129
And you need a hot shower,
and you need a good meal,

1124
01:28:59.400 --> 01:29:03.321
and some rest, and some food.

1125
01:29:04.800 --> 01:29:09.210
And I'm going to book
you a hotel room.

1126
01:29:10.000 --> 01:29:14.250
No, I think it's best if you
just stay with me tonight.

1127
01:29:20.880 --> 01:29:24.159
You know, it's just safer...

1128
01:29:24.160 --> 01:29:25.600
If you stay with me.

1129
01:29:30.520 --> 01:29:32.404
Right? Yeah.

1130
01:29:47.280 --> 01:29:49.562
Look at you. Okay.

1131
01:30:44.320 --> 01:30:45.965
<i>Beast,</i>

1132
01:30:46.520 --> 01:30:47.919
<i>we've been hit.</i>

1133
01:30:47.920 --> 01:30:49.759
All right, we're on our way.
We're on our way.

1134
01:30:49.760 --> 01:30:51.199
- Track them.
- I'm on it.

1135
01:30:51.200 --> 01:30:52.399
Where is he?

1136
01:30:52.400 --> 01:30:54.360
He's up on California
and Mason. Make a left.

1137
01:30:57.720 --> 01:30:59.081
Are you okay?

1138
01:31:02.160 --> 01:31:07.082
Go. Before the cops get here, go.

1139
01:31:08.640 --> 01:31:10.046
God!

1140
01:31:22.640 --> 01:31:25.571
I got you. I got you.

1141
01:31:25.880 --> 01:31:28.559
<i>Units, be advised, getting
report of a vehicle roll-over.</i>

1142
01:31:28.560 --> 01:31:30.330
<i>115 Nob Hill.</i>

1143
01:31:40.840 --> 01:31:42.879
<i>Unit 1-David responding. Code 3.</i>

1144
01:31:42.880 --> 01:31:44.320
Holy shit.

1145
01:31:44.920 --> 01:31:46.119
Open the door.
We gotta let them in.

1146
01:31:46.120 --> 01:31:47.881
- We gotta make this quick.
- All right.

1147
01:31:50.080 --> 01:31:52.879
Yo, we gotta move. Cops are coming.

1148
01:31:52.880 --> 01:31:54.359
Came in over the scanner.
We gotta go!

1149
01:31:54.360 --> 01:31:55.759
Come on, man.

1150
01:31:55.760 --> 01:31:57.200
We gotta go.

1151
01:31:58.840 --> 01:32:00.159
Tobey, you guys good?

1152
01:32:00.160 --> 01:32:01.719
We need a hospital.

1153
01:32:01.720 --> 01:32:04.121
- Find a hospital. Find a hospital.
- I'm working on it.

1154
01:32:07.920 --> 01:32:10.327
All right, I got a hospital
on Hill. Make a left.

1155
01:32:21.360 --> 01:32:24.040
Wait! We need your help.

1156
01:32:30.480 --> 01:32:32.648
What's her name? Did she
ever lose consciousness?

1157
01:32:32.960 --> 01:32:36.323
Julia. Yeah, she's been in and out.

1158
01:32:36.480 --> 01:32:38.330
- You stay with her, all right?
- I will.

1159
01:32:38.400 --> 01:32:40.523
- Take care of her.
- Come on. We gotta go.

1160
01:32:42.640 --> 01:32:44.365
- Go, go, go.
- We're here.

1161
01:33:45.200 --> 01:33:47.243
Anita,

1162
01:33:49.120 --> 01:33:52.130
why don't you just leave him?

1163
01:34:01.720 --> 01:34:03.888
I just did.

1164
01:34:14.240 --> 01:34:17.559
I know that Dino was there
the night my brother died.

1165
01:34:17.560 --> 01:34:20.570
Yeah. He was.

1166
01:34:22.280 --> 01:34:24.642
I wish I could give you
those years back.

1167
01:34:26.560 --> 01:34:28.599
Anita,

1168
01:34:28.600 --> 01:34:30.848
I need a car.

1169
01:34:51.400 --> 01:34:53.284
I'm sorry, Tobey.

1170
01:34:55.600 --> 01:34:57.643
So am I.

1171
01:36:00.840 --> 01:36:02.883
Why wouldn't he destroy it?

1172
01:36:03.920 --> 01:36:05.565
I have no idea.

1173
01:36:05.720 --> 01:36:09.720
I guess some people just don't
think they'll ever get caught.

1174
01:36:49.840 --> 01:36:51.041
How is she?

1175
01:36:52.560 --> 01:36:56.651
Arm is broke. Waiting
on the CAT scan.

1176
01:37:46.600 --> 01:37:48.211
Hey.

1177
01:37:51.280 --> 01:37:53.005
How you feeling?

1178
01:37:59.440 --> 01:38:01.290
Beat up.

1179
01:38:02.560 --> 01:38:04.808
But I'm fine.

1180
01:38:09.120 --> 01:38:11.004
You know...

1181
01:38:12.480 --> 01:38:14.682
You are not the girl
I thought you were.

1182
01:38:15.080 --> 01:38:20.207
Well, you learn a lot about a person
when they've been hit by a truck.

1183
01:38:29.240 --> 01:38:32.205
What are you gonna
do about tomorrow?

1184
01:38:33.480 --> 01:38:35.762
I found a car.

1185
01:38:38.160 --> 01:38:41.603
Do I wanna know where
you found the car?

1186
01:38:42.080 --> 01:38:44.119
No, you don't.

1187
01:38:44.120 --> 01:38:46.163
Is it fast?

1188
01:38:46.800 --> 01:38:49.401
It's fast enough, yeah.

1189
01:38:59.320 --> 01:39:01.204
Do it for Pete.

1190
01:39:02.040 --> 01:39:03.730
What?

1191
01:39:06.600 --> 01:39:10.122
This is for Pete.

1192
01:39:17.520 --> 01:39:19.210
Yeah.

1193
01:39:54.320 --> 01:39:57.919
This is, by far, the best De
Leon I've ever put together.

1194
01:39:57.920 --> 01:40:01.283
<i>This is my David, man.
This is my Pieta.</i>

1195
01:40:01.560 --> 01:40:03.649
This is my <i>Soup Can.</i>

1196
01:40:11.240 --> 01:40:13.199
Is it possible to get a laptop?

1197
01:40:13.200 --> 01:40:15.243
Sure. I'll be right back.

1198
01:40:29.280 --> 01:40:31.881
Hey, what's up, baby?
What's your name?

1199
01:40:33.480 --> 01:40:34.599
Right.

1200
01:40:34.600 --> 01:40:38.282
Do you have an iPad
I can borrow? Please?

1201
01:40:41.720 --> 01:40:42.959
<i>We've got our lineup.</i>

1202
01:40:42.960 --> 01:40:45.322
<i>Each driver takes his
spot at the starting line.</i>

1203
01:40:45.400 --> 01:40:48.199
<i>In the first row is English
Paul in a Bugatti Veyron</i>

1204
01:40:48.200 --> 01:40:50.801
<i>and Dino Brewster in his
Lamborghini Elemento.</i>

1205
01:40:51.000 --> 01:40:54.079
Row two is the Gooch
in a Saleen S7.

1206
01:40:54.080 --> 01:40:56.679
<i>Texas Mike is in the McLaren P1.</i>

1207
01:40:56.680 --> 01:41:00.168
<i>The third row has Johnny
V in his GTA Spano.</i>

1208
01:41:01.360 --> 01:41:05.039
I'm looking at $7 million in cars

1209
01:41:05.040 --> 01:41:08.403
and thousands of horsepower.
Winner takes all.

1210
01:41:08.440 --> 01:41:11.564
Losers, y'all can walk home.

1211
01:41:14.760 --> 01:41:16.279
<i>No sign of Tobey Marshall.</i>

1212
01:41:16.280 --> 01:41:19.399
<i>I don't really know what
all that's about, but I...</i>

1213
01:41:19.400 --> 01:41:21.443
<i>Hold up. Wait, hold on.</i>

1214
01:41:27.360 --> 01:41:29.199
Wait a minute, now.

1215
01:41:29.200 --> 01:41:32.802
A sixth car has just
arrived, but I can't...

1216
01:41:44.880 --> 01:41:48.926
<i>Tobey Marshall just stepped
out of a red Agera.</i>

1217
01:41:50.080 --> 01:41:52.726
Well! Maybe the
little tart was right

1218
01:41:53.000 --> 01:41:58.081
about there being three
Koenigseggs the day Pete died.

1219
01:42:19.840 --> 01:42:23.522
You like the car I brought?
Because I know the cops will.

1220
01:42:25.560 --> 01:42:28.159
And by the way,

1221
01:42:28.160 --> 01:42:30.931
I think this belongs to you.

1222
01:43:45.080 --> 01:43:47.799
<i>Tobey Marshall and Johnny
V are battling for fifth.</i>

1223
01:43:47.800 --> 01:43:49.400
You got it, you got it, you got it.

1224
01:43:55.480 --> 01:43:57.079
<i>And Johnny V is off the road.</i>

1225
01:43:57.080 --> 01:43:58.520
Come on, come on, come on!

1226
01:44:40.840 --> 01:44:43.199
<i>Golden Gate, this is H1.
I got ops on them.</i>

1227
01:44:43.200 --> 01:44:44.526
<i>Westbound 128.</i>

1228
01:44:48.440 --> 01:44:51.928
Tobey Marshall's gonna roll the dice and
try to split the Saleen and the P1.

1229
01:45:00.080 --> 01:45:01.439
- Yo, yo, yo.
<i>- And he does it.</i>

1230
01:45:01.440 --> 01:45:02.959
Yo, that's my dude right
there. That's my dude.

1231
01:45:02.960 --> 01:45:04.399
<i>- Ladies and gentlemen...</i>
- Y'all come check this out.

1232
01:45:04.400 --> 01:45:06.599
Marshall's balls have
just been located

1233
01:45:06.600 --> 01:45:09.239
and they are very, very large.

1234
01:45:09.240 --> 01:45:13.399
<i>Texas Mike in the McLaren is now
fifth, Tobey is now running fourth.</i>

1235
01:45:13.400 --> 01:45:16.843
<i>Dino Brewster, you better
watch your ass, son.</i>

1236
01:45:23.240 --> 01:45:25.519
Suspects approaching
150 miles per hour.

1237
01:45:25.520 --> 01:45:27.324
H1 will try to stall them.

1238
01:45:27.560 --> 01:45:29.683
<i>All units, 10-3.</i>

1239
01:45:31.960 --> 01:45:35.767
I've got flying cops. I've
got flies in the ointment.

1240
01:45:35.880 --> 01:45:38.559
<i>I got CHP in the air
all over the course.</i>

1241
01:45:38.560 --> 01:45:40.559
<i>You add cops to the
race and people get...</i>

1242
01:45:40.560 --> 01:45:43.331
<i>Racers should race,
cops should eat donuts.</i>

1243
01:46:04.320 --> 01:46:07.599
<i>All units, disregard the spike strips.
They're moving too fast.</i>

1244
01:46:07.600 --> 01:46:08.759
They'll get past the
deployment spot.

1245
01:46:08.760 --> 01:46:10.439
Let's try the rolling
block instead.

1246
01:46:10.440 --> 01:46:11.679
<i>18-4, roger?</i>

1247
01:46:11.680 --> 01:46:13.879
<i>18-2, six on Code 3.</i>

1248
01:46:13.880 --> 01:46:16.287
Rolling block in formation, check.

1249
01:46:55.920 --> 01:47:00.523
The Gooch in the Saleen has
been totally taken out.

1250
01:47:00.760 --> 01:47:02.849
<i>I can't believe what I'm seeing.</i>

1251
01:47:03.440 --> 01:47:06.519
<i>British Paul holds first,
Dino is still in second,</i>

1252
01:47:06.520 --> 01:47:08.039
<i>Tobey Marshall moves into third.</i>

1253
01:47:08.040 --> 01:47:09.519
Yeah, boy.

1254
01:47:09.520 --> 01:47:11.131
All right, brother, keep it going.

1255
01:47:11.960 --> 01:47:15.209
<i>Dispatch, officers involved
in TC. I need rescue, now.</i>

1256
01:47:29.800 --> 01:47:32.241
<i>All units, they TC'd into
two of our officers.</i>

1257
01:47:34.840 --> 01:47:38.599
<i>Be advised, five suspect vehicles
are entering the tree line.</i>

1258
01:47:38.600 --> 01:47:41.039
<i>Consider using lethal force.</i>

1259
01:47:41.040 --> 01:47:42.685
They're at mile marker 27.

1260
01:48:43.280 --> 01:48:46.039
<i>Dispatch, confirm rescue is rolling.
We have another officer down</i>

1261
01:48:46.040 --> 01:48:48.846
as well as another suspect.
18-5, are you set up for the pit?

1262
01:48:49.120 --> 01:48:51.049
18-5 in position.

1263
01:49:07.200 --> 01:49:09.079
Suspects approaching
on a five count.

1264
01:49:09.080 --> 01:49:10.884
18-5, countdown begins.

1265
01:49:13.800 --> 01:49:15.001
<i>Five,</i>

1266
01:49:16.800 --> 01:49:18.001
<i>four,</i>

1267
01:49:19.440 --> 01:49:20.641
<i>three,</i>

1268
01:49:21.320 --> 01:49:22.681
<i>two,</i>

1269
01:49:23.000 --> 01:49:24.201
<i>on 8.</i>

1270
01:49:45.280 --> 01:49:47.926
<i>18-5, perfect pit.
Lead suspect down.</i>

1271
01:49:48.040 --> 01:49:52.479
I'm hearing over scanners,
the Bugatti has just got taken out.

1272
01:49:52.480 --> 01:49:54.330
Man. Wait a minute...

1273
01:49:54.880 --> 01:49:58.399
Wait a minute, Tobey Marshall has
somehow just taken the lead.

1274
01:49:58.400 --> 01:50:01.604
<i>Dino Brewster is running
last in third place?</i>

1275
01:50:02.000 --> 01:50:04.601
<i>- Are you kidding me?</i>
- Hold that lead! Hold that lead!

1276
01:50:05.480 --> 01:50:07.045
And then there were three.

1277
01:50:07.280 --> 01:50:09.448
<i>We need containment set
at Navarro Bridge.</i>

1278
01:50:21.560 --> 01:50:25.810
<i>H1, Mendo PD is Code
3 to Navarro Bridge.</i>

1279
01:50:31.440 --> 01:50:33.559
They're coming up to the
race marker to the bridge.

1280
01:50:33.560 --> 01:50:36.039
<i>Tobey is clearly running first.
I can't believe it.</i>

1281
01:50:36.040 --> 01:50:39.719
<i>The blue collar kid from Mount Kisco is
trying to wear Cinderella's slipper.</i>

1282
01:50:39.720 --> 01:50:42.241
That's my dude!
Mount Kisco, let's go!

1283
01:50:57.280 --> 01:51:01.039
<i>By the way, these cop cars,
they top out at about 130.</i>

1284
01:51:01.040 --> 01:51:03.004
Hold them back, baby!
Hold them back.

1285
01:51:03.040 --> 01:51:05.846
Good luck catching up, Smokey.
I'll tell you who wins.

1286
01:51:36.840 --> 01:51:38.326
Come on!

1287
01:52:02.120 --> 01:52:03.879
<i>Dispatch, another suspect is down.</i>

1288
01:52:03.880 --> 01:52:05.684
<i>Only two remaining.</i>

1289
01:52:09.440 --> 01:52:12.450
<i>The Elemento just flicked
the P1 into a roll.</i>

1290
01:52:12.480 --> 01:52:16.571
<i>We're down to Tobey
Marshall and Dino Brewster.</i>

1291
01:52:18.240 --> 01:52:19.965
This ain't just about racing.

1292
01:52:50.520 --> 01:52:53.200
Don't do it. Tobey,
don't let him do it.

1293
01:53:19.320 --> 01:53:21.999
Tobey Marshall just let
the Elemento get by him.

1294
01:53:22.000 --> 01:53:23.319
- Nice move.
<i>- That kid better wake up.</i>

1295
01:53:23.320 --> 01:53:24.759
<i>Wake up, Toby!</i>

1296
01:53:24.760 --> 01:53:29.409
Wake up and smell that $2
million Lambo in your pocket.

1297
01:54:01.920 --> 01:54:05.090
Don't do it, brother. It's not
worth it. You can beat him.

1298
01:54:10.800 --> 01:54:13.651
Pete... I need you, pal.

1299
01:54:23.440 --> 01:54:24.801
Okay, let's go.

1300
01:54:58.360 --> 01:55:03.009
<i>Jeez, Dino took a swing and
missed and flipped the Elemento.</i>

1301
01:55:03.720 --> 01:55:07.039
<i>Dino Brewster is out.
Down goes Dino!</i>

1302
01:55:07.040 --> 01:55:09.559
Thank you, thank you, thank you!

1303
01:55:09.560 --> 01:55:12.599
<i>Tobey is the last man standing!
He's gonna win the De Leon!</i>

1304
01:55:12.600 --> 01:55:14.279
He's gonna win the De Leon!

1305
01:55:14.280 --> 01:55:17.559
The Marshall kid from Mount Kisco!
He's gonna make a milk run to victory!

1306
01:55:17.560 --> 01:55:19.959
That's right! That's my boy!
That's my dude!

1307
01:55:19.960 --> 01:55:21.919
That's right. Give me space.
I'm about to twerk it out.

1308
01:55:21.920 --> 01:55:23.319
<i>Tobey is the last man standing!</i>

1309
01:55:23.320 --> 01:55:26.039
- Get it. Hit it, hit it.
<i>- He's gonna win the De Leon!</i>

1310
01:55:26.040 --> 01:55:27.759
I can't believe what I'm seeing!

1311
01:55:27.760 --> 01:55:31.009
The kid from Mount Kisco!
The blue collar kid!

1312
01:55:48.720 --> 01:55:50.559
Wait! Wait.

1313
01:55:50.560 --> 01:55:51.839
What are you doing?

1314
01:55:51.840 --> 01:55:53.800
- What are you doing?
- Why are you stopping?

1315
01:56:19.760 --> 01:56:21.724
Come on. Come on.

1316
01:56:23.880 --> 01:56:25.320
Come on.

1317
01:56:31.440 --> 01:56:32.999
Hey, you okay?

1318
01:56:33.000 --> 01:56:36.283
Yeah. I'm fine.

1319
01:56:39.080 --> 01:56:40.486
I'm fine.

1320
01:56:40.800 --> 01:56:43.162
Good. This is for Pete.

1321
01:58:10.520 --> 01:58:12.210
Let me see your hands!

1322
01:58:17.760 --> 01:58:19.199
Let me see your hands!

1323
01:58:19.200 --> 01:58:20.481
Now!

1324
01:59:03.400 --> 01:59:05.921
Stand up! Keep your hands
where I can see them.

1325
01:59:06.440 --> 01:59:10.239
<i>18-7, Euro plates
Sam-Mary-Harry, 2-2-8,</i>

1326
01:59:10.240 --> 01:59:12.119
<i>registered to a Dino Brewster.</i>

1327
01:59:12.120 --> 01:59:14.482
Well, now, hold on, cretins.

1328
01:59:15.160 --> 01:59:18.199
I'm hearing over the
scanners that the Koenigsegg

1329
01:59:18.200 --> 01:59:20.359
does indeed belong to Dino

1330
01:59:20.360 --> 01:59:22.767
and that's the missing
evidence that killed Pete.

1331
01:59:25.120 --> 01:59:27.399
Well, then it looks
like Dino, Dino bambino

1332
01:59:27.400 --> 01:59:30.683
is going away for a
long, long time.

1333
02:00:17.760 --> 02:00:20.439
Well, kiddos, it looks
like Tobey himself

1334
02:00:20.440 --> 02:00:22.679
is gonna enjoy three hots
and a cot in the pokey

1335
02:00:22.680 --> 02:00:24.689
for illegal street racing.

1336
02:00:26.680 --> 02:00:27.927
I don't know, Tobey.

1337
02:00:29.120 --> 02:00:31.800
A few months in jail to
prove your innocence.

1338
02:00:33.680 --> 02:00:35.644
<i>Was it worth it, kid?</i>

1339
02:01:11.000 --> 02:01:12.770
All right. Step forward.

1340
02:02:00.200 --> 02:02:01.925
Get in!

1341
02:02:02.120 --> 02:02:03.845
I'll drive.

1342
02:02:03.920 --> 02:02:06.851
I've seen you drive
and it's terrifying.

1343
02:02:11.760 --> 02:02:13.371
<i>Come on, lovebirds.</i>

1344
02:02:13.760 --> 02:02:15.399
<i>We need to get Benny
out of the clink.</i>

1345
02:02:15.400 --> 02:02:17.359
<i>Maverick is getting out
for good behavior.</i>

1346
02:02:17.360 --> 02:02:19.599
<i>Yeah, apparently he started
some fitness program</i>

1347
02:02:19.600 --> 02:02:21.119
<i>for the inmates or some shit.</i>

1348
02:02:21.120 --> 02:02:22.810
<i>We got five hours to get to Utah.</i>

1349
02:02:22.920 --> 02:02:24.201
<i>Let's go.</i>

1350
02:02:54.760 --> 02:02:56.399
Yeah.

1351
02:02:56.400 --> 02:02:58.399
Yeah, that's right, baby.

1352
02:02:58.400 --> 02:02:59.999
You're rocking with the champ.

1353
02:03:00.000 --> 02:03:02.279
You're rocking with the champ.
Number one.

1354
02:03:02.280 --> 02:03:05.199
Don't even call me Maverick no more.
Call me Benny the Champ.

1355
02:03:05.200 --> 02:03:07.479
That's right, baby. That's good,
Jeff. I see you, Jeff.

1356
02:03:07.480 --> 02:03:10.479
What are you doing?
What are you doing, Gerald?

1357
02:03:10.480 --> 02:03:11.799
Twerk!

1358
02:03:11.800 --> 02:03:14.079
You know what? You got a solo.
Come on over here.

1359
02:03:14.080 --> 02:03:16.679
Let's see the solo, bro.
Let's see the solo.

1360
02:03:16.680 --> 02:03:19.451
Get it, Gerald! Get it, bro!

1361
02:03:22.040 --> 02:03:24.004
That's what I'm talking
about, bro! Yes!
